    "identifier": "uzumaki-uzumaki-art-chakra-suppression",
    "description": "<p>You quickly deploy a suppressive seal at a point you can see within range. You throw the suppressive seal and it lands on the chosen point, and radiate 10-foot radius aura centered on it.</p>\n<p>For the duration, creatures that begin or end their turn in the aura or would enter the aura for the first time on their turns, must make a Charisma saving throw, being unable to cast jutsu of a rank equal to this jutsu when it was cast.</p>\n<p>Seal Break. If a hostile creature within the jutsu’s radius has ranks of Sealed, you can dispel one rank of that creatures Sealed condition to increase the size of the radius by +5 feet.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3.</p>",
